# Web design tokens

- Full token catalog and component recipes: [`.agents/docs/DESIGN.md`](../docs/DESIGN.md).
- Prefer CSS variables from `apps/web/src/styles/global.css`: `--color-*`, `--space-*`, `--radius-*`, `--font-sans` (Sora).
- Keep the established dark green Places look; do **not** invent purple/cream/light landing themes on Places surfaces.
- Mapbox layer/paint colors **should** stay centralized under `MapView` map-layer helpers, not scattered as one-off hex in random modules.
- Match existing component spacing and borders; avoid decorative multi-shadow / glow patterns that fight the system.
